# Secrets and local config: never commit
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Uploads stay local (health data). The SFDA dataset under data/ is versioned (owner's decision,
# 2026-11-19) so every machine has the same data; keep each file under GitHub's 100 MB limit.
/uploads/
/data/lists-trial/
# Run logs and one-off backups of the crawl and picture jobs (the data files themselves are kept).
/data/media/*.log
/data/media/*.stdout
/data/media/*.prev
/data/media/*.bak
/data/media/*.pre-*
/data/media/restore-report.json
/data/refresh/
/data/knowledge/*.log
/data/lists/*.log

